Both series select the reports currently merged into this ticket. The window includes 30 March through 4 October, with an exclusive end of 5 October. Use the received series for when these reports arrived; use the merged series for desk activity. Neither series is total desk traffic or a booking failure rate. The apparent merge spike does not date the onset of the bugs.

## What the desk changes now

Use the [revised triage procedure](/kb/triage/dedupe) and [replacement decision](/kb/decisions/0002-dedupe-by-evidence). Read the report body before merging. Join tenant locale and form metadata, compare the affected path and symptom, and keep uncertain reports open for investigation. Subject text and intake tags help find candidates; neither authorizes a merge.

Keep one issue per verified problem path and count each report ID once within that issue. Preserve the one-day annotations inside parser filing without promoting an uncertain symptom into a new root cause. Record received and merged times separately. Recompute these views when the desk exports new data, and recheck live issue state before relying on this snapshot.

